# Citation metadata for Sewall.ai. GitHub shows a "Cite this repository" box from this file.
# The DOI is minted by Zenodo when a GitHub release of QinLab/sewall.ai is published with the
# Zenodo integration enabled. Add the concept DOI under "identifiers" after the first release;
# none exists yet, so none is listed here.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Sewall.ai: a bounded, inspectable agentic harness over public biological data"
abstract: >-
  Sewall.ai is a research prototype toward a federated, policy-aware, model-agnostic agentic
  data harness. This release runs over public NCBI metadata and Earth Engine summaries; custodian
  federation is not yet implemented. A planner model, a scripted plan or an MCP host selects
  versioned scientific Skills. A deterministic controller checks every
  action against the Skill registry, access policies and budgets, and writes a manifest that
  can be replayed and verified offline.
authors:
  - given-names: Hong
    family-names: Qin
    affiliation: "Old Dominion University"
version: 0.1.2
date-released: 2026-10-08
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/QinLab/sewall.ai"
keywords:
  - agentic AI
  - scientific data
  - provenance
  - Model Context Protocol
  - NCBI
  - Earth Engine
  - AI-ready datasets
